flowchart LR
 S["I01-I03<br/>source inventory, dispositions<br/>offline custody"]:::source --> B["I04-I18<br/>isolated router, host, identities<br/>data and native applications"]:::process
 B --> CAP["I23<br/>consistent generation<br/>independent backup receipts"]:::process
 CAP --> REST["I24<br/>isolated restore<br/>all external effects HOLD"]:::process
 REST --> TEST{"Functional, privacy<br/>and failure tests passed?"}:::gate
 TEST -- "No" --> FIX["Resolve B01-B12 / new blockers<br/>no cutover"]:::hold
 TEST -- "Yes" --> FENCE["I25<br/>quiesce source; revoke old owner<br/>capture final delta"]:::process
 FENCE --> CANARY["Switch DNS / ingress deliberately<br/>reconcile providers; channel canaries"]:::process
 CANARY --> OK{"Single writer and<br/>canary accepted?"}:::gate
 OK -- "Yes" --> LIVE["Approved channel-by-channel release<br/>measured objectives, not assumed HA"]:::done
 OK -- "No" --> ROLL["I26<br/>hold target; preserve new writes<br/>reconcile before rollback"]:::hold
 ROLL --> REST
 LIVE --> DR["I27 / I33<br/>power and reboot recovery<br/>return to HOLD until reconciled"]:::control
 DR --> REST


